{"overview":"یک روز سرنوشت ساز، تمام بشریت در اثر نور کور کننده‌ای خشکشان می‌زند. پس از چند هزار سال، دانش آموز دبیرستانی تایجو بیدار می‌شود و خود را گمشده در دنیایی از مجسمه‌ها می‌یابد. با این حال، او تنها نیست! دوست علم‌دوست او، سنکو، چند ماهی است که بیدار شده است و اعلام آمادگی می‌کند، او یک برنامه بزرگ در ذهن دارد، راه‌اندازی تمدن با قدرت علم!","tagline":"","overview_en":"One fateful day, all of humanity was petrified by a blinding flash of light. After several millennia, high schooler Taiju awakens and finds himself lost in a world of statues. However, he’s not alone! His science-loving friend Senku’s been up and running for a few months and he's got a grand plan in mind—to kickstart civilization with the power of science!","tagline_en":"This is exhilarating... get excited!","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2019,"poster":"/1N9yxroBNOUyyZ7mbRPkz53K0bx.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2019,"poster":"/8kprUznHSw5VJyOd2lOtzwmowUM.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":11,"y":2021,"poster":"/5j6rQvce7gLOtCpxOA1wHF7Gt5s.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":22,"y":2023,"poster":"/fYsHfa3JhZ00F1MDcFvWL3Zovk6.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":37,"y":2025,"poster":"/2C7lHKeWY7k1qEtTKecUHuqKv1X.jpg"}],"episodes":94,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小林裕介","role":"Senku Ishigami (voice)","photo":"/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","en":"Yusuke Kobayashi"},{"name":"古川慎","role":"Taiju Oki (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"name":"市ノ瀬加那","role":"Yuzuriha Ogawa (voice)","photo":"/hBJx5tpLA2vkXqfkPZosGjW4e8C.jpg","en":"Kana Ichinose"},{"name":"沼倉愛美","role":"Kohaku (voice)","photo":"/eDbMXgeTCA2D6i7894Ag43RADrk.jpg","en":"Manami Numakura"},{"name":"佐藤元","role":"Chrome (voice)","photo":"/gdKxR84xGgU19eqWlPKEGZsiID6.jpg","en":"Gen Sato"},{"name":"河西健吾","role":"Asagiri Gen (voice)","photo":"/s0CxrO6LixJBgqiHEUjKelAh8ei.jpg","en":"Kengo Kawanishi"},{"name":"ریوتا سوزوکی","role":"